                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Even though I got this for about $0.30 in a bundle, I can't recommend.\n\nWorst offenses:\n\n- Bugs - if you pause the game, exit to menu, and continue, your character is gone and the menu persists.\n- 30fps with screen tearing (no vsync). \n- Bad 3 second sound loop that isn't even music.\n- Horrible, floaty and weak jumping mechanics. \n- Confusing story...it was a few random undecipherable scenes replayed several times? \n- Not fun \n\n3/10. I can forgive 30fps and rough-around-the-edges games. But not flat out bugs, annoying sound (doesn't even count as sound), and frustratingly bad jumping in a platformer.",
